# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF. CI and the Pages workflow run on Linux and read
# these files directly, so keeping one convention in the repository avoids checked-in CRLF reaching
# a shell script or muddying a diff. Windows working copies still get native endings on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be transformed.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
